name: Metadata scores preserve review authority and a finite allowance
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: findings
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
submit: decision fp Owned public example is not an active credential
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART decided
submit: options classifier-gate:score
require-live-snap: 25 Experimental | experimental-score
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unbound
paste-file: @ART/approve-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance-review
expect: Total provider calls: 4
expect: Protected review calls: 4
resize: 160x48
live-snap: allowance-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: allowance-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: allowance-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: allowance-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: allowance-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-controls-40x12
ask: Can you read the four-call metadata allowance, selected model, protected Review category and unknown dollars at all six sizes without approving further investigation?
keys: y
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | allowance-approved
paste-file: @ART/invalid-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 targetPercentile | invalid-percentile
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
paste-file: @ART/empty-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART empty
paste-file: @ART/partial-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Classifier unscored | partial-opinion
expect: Outcome · partial
resize: 160x48
live-snap: partial-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: partial-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: partial-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: partial-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: partial-40x12
expect: Classifier unscored
keys: Tab
live-snap: partial-full-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-reading-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-reading-40x12-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-reading-40x12-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-reading-40x12-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-reading-40x12-5
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-reading-40x12-6
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-reading-40x12-7
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-reading-40x12-8
ask: Is the missing score clearly partial and distinct from a false-positive decision, with complete metadata limitations reachable by paging and no follow-up starting?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/zero-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART zero
paste-file: @ART/zero-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Classifier score 0.000 | exact-zero
keys: Escape
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/different-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART different
paste-file: @ART/bad-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART bad
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 4/4 | retained-accounting
paste-file: @ART/exhausted-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 allowance exhausted | limit-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Finding review completeness does not describe repository coverage. | retained-report
expect: TP: 0
keys: Home
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | export-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 4/4 | recovered-accounting
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/classifier_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart retain the human false-positive decision, exact zero score, separate percentile samples and exhausted allowance without new Review completion or follow-up work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
